@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FB
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #355777
skinparam ActorBorderColor #355777
skinparam ArrowColor #355777
hide footbox
autonumber
title Atomically erase account and owned data

' Sources relative to repository root:
' backend/app/api/routes/account.py
' backend/app/services/accounts.py
' backend/app/models/common_word.py
' backend/app/models/prompt_job.py

actor Client
participant "FastAPI route" as API
participant "Service" as S
database PostgreSQL as DB
ref over Client, DB : 02_access_authentication: resolve active bearer session or return 401
note over API : Invalid request parameters / body return 422 before service execution.

Client -> API : DELETE /api/v1/account
API -> S : delete_account(db, user)
S -> DB : Lock active User FOR UPDATE; recheck status
break Account unavailable
  S --> API : AccountUnavailable
  API --> Client : 401
end
S -> DB : Set deleted_at; FLUSH erasure marker
S -> DB : DELETE AuthSessions, CommonWordJobs, CommonWordQuestions
S -> DB : DELETE ReviewAttempts, ReviewStates and Words
note right of DB : Word deletion cascades to its PromptJob.\nThe erasure marker satisfies deletion protection triggers.
S -> DB : DELETE User; COMMIT all erasure changes
S --> API : Done
API --> Client : 204; delete refresh cookie; Cache-Control: no-store
note over S, DB : Concurrent account mutations serialize on the User lock.\nWorkers recheck account and lease before persisting generated data.
@enduml
